OL,3,GNEWSAWill the summer drought affect my
OL,4,AChristmas tree?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of us have already put up our
OL,7,FChristmas trees, some are thinking
OL,8,Fabout doing so soon, and some will be
OL,9,Fleaving it until much nearer the big
OL,10,Fday before getting round to it.
OL,12,FBut regardless of our timings, how have
OL,13,Four Christmas trees been impacted by
OL,14,Fthis year's prolonged hot weather and
OL,15,Fdrought?
OL,17,FGrowers have told the BBC of the
OL,18,Fdevastating loss of hundreds of younger
OL,19,Ftrees, and some farmers have started to
OL,20,Ffuture-proof their crops.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
